https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qt2FWAbXinY  (Capo 0)

Two versions available, this one in C and one in G.  If there are two guitarists present have one play this version uncapo'd and the other play the version in G capo'd at the 5th fret.  Both will be in C but an octave apart.  Sounds real pretty.

TIP:  Leonard wrote some 80 verses of this song and over 300 versions have been recorded so the "favorite" version is a matter of preference.  The link here is to a version by Lind, Holm, Fuentes, and Nilsen.  At the end are a couple of other popular verses that you can cut and paste.    


